# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your own values.
# .env.local is git-ignored (see .gitignore's `.env*.local` rule) so your
# real keys never get committed.

# Google Maps API key, used by react-native-maps on the native Android/iOS
# builds (Home, Route Planning, and Report screens). Without this, those
# screens crash with "API key not found" on a real device build.
#
# Get one free at https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials
#   1. Create/select a project
#   2. Enable "Maps SDK for Android" (and "Maps SDK for iOS" if you build iOS)
#   3. Credentials -> Create Credentials -> API key
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
